<meta name="description" content="As a global leader in the field of electronic measurement, RIGOL provides test and measurement instruments and solutions to over 90 countries and regions around the world. It has 10 major product lines, such as the DG70000 series waveform generators and digital oscilloscopes, which feature advantages like high sampling rate and high bandwidth. With 437 invention patents, it helps you make accurate measurements and tackle testing challenges!">
