</div>
<div data-animation="5" class="swiper is-industry-info">
<div class="swiper-wrapper is-industry-info">
<div class="swiper-slide is-industry-info">
<div class="swiper-slide-content is-industry-info">
<div data-css-animate-type="slidedown" data-css-animate="1" class="industry_slide-text fix_richtext_p "><p>Communication technology is reshaping the world at an unprecedented speed. From the evolution of 5G, the Internet of Everything to the next-generation optical communication, the entire industry is moving towards the limits of higher frequencies, larger bandwidths, and more complex protocols.</p>
<p>This trend poses severe testing challenges for product R&amp;D, conformance verification, and mass production: How to accurately characterize the performance of millimeter-wave devices? How to verify the signal integrity of ultra-high-speed digital interfaces? How to ensure the stability and reliability of complex communication protocols?</p>
<p>We provide end-to-end testing solutions&nbsp;covering radio frequency microwave, high-speed digital signals, and protocol analysis. We are committed to helping customers overcome various design challenges from chips to systems through accurate and efficient measurements, accelerating the product launch process, and seizing the opportunity in the rapidly developing communication market.</p>
</div>
<div class="g_spacer spacer-8"></div>
<div data-css-animate-type="slidedown" data-css-animate="2" class="btn-group is-center">
<div data-wf--var-old-btn--variant="primary" class="btn_component">
<a href="/intl/solutions/communication.html" class="btn w-inline-block">
<p class="btn_text">Learn more</p>
<div class="btn_hover-overlay"></div>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="swiper-slide is-industry-info">
<div class="swiper-slide-content is-industry-info">
<div data-css-animate-type="slidedown" data-css-animate="1" class="industry_slide-text fix_richtext_p "><p>With the rapid development of intelligent vehicles, autonomous driving, and Internet of Vehicles (IoV) technologies, automotive electronic systems are undergoing accelerated transformation. This evolution covers multiple areas including smart cockpits, intelligent driving, powertrain systems, and body electronics. Accordingly, the demand for comprehensive automotive electronics testing is also increasing. RIGOL provides an extensive range of testing solutions, covering automotive bus testing such as CAN/CAN-FD, FlexRay, and Automotive Ethernet, high-speed data interface testing including LVDS, MIPI, and eDP, peripheral interface testing such as USB and SD, as well as power integrity analysis.</p>
</div>
<div class="g_spacer spacer-8"></div>
<div data-css-animate-type="slidedown" data-css-animate="2" class="btn-group is-center">
<div data-wf--var-old-btn--variant="primary" class="btn_component">
<a href="/intl/solutions/automotive-electronics.html" class="btn w-inline-block">
<p class="btn_text">Learn more</p>
<div class="btn_hover-overlay"></div>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="swiper-slide is-industry-info">
<div class="swiper-slide-content is-industry-info">
<div data-css-animate-type="slidedown" data-css-animate="1" class="industry_slide-text fix_richtext_p "><p>Driven by the global energy transition and the wave of electrification, power electronics technology is at the core of industry innovation. From new energy power generation, electric vehicles to high-efficiency data centers, the market&#39;s demand for higher power density, ultimate conversion efficiency, and excellent reliability is becoming increasingly urgent. The widespread application of third-generation semiconductors represented by silicon carbide (SiC) and gallium nitride (GaN) has pushed the switching frequency and operating voltage to new heights, and also brought unprecedented challenges to testing and measurement. We provide a complete measurement solution ranging from dynamic characteristic analysis of power devices, evaluation of converter efficiency and power quality, to control loop stability testing.</p>
<p>RIGOL is committed to helping engineers gain in-depth insights into design details through accurate, reliable, and safe testing tools, accelerating the R &amp; D process, and ensuring that your products lead in performance and are stable and reliable in the fierce market competition.</p>
</div>
<div class="g_spacer spacer-8"></div>
<div data-css-animate-type="slidedown" data-css-animate="2" class="btn-group is-center">
<div data-wf--var-old-btn--variant="primary" class="btn_component">
<a href="/intl/solutions/power-analysis.html" class="btn w-inline-block">
<p class="btn_text">Learn more</p>
<div class="btn_hover-overlay"></div>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div data-animation="6" class="btn-group is-center">
<div class="btn-text_component">
<a href="/intl/solutions" class="btn is-text  w-inline-block">
<div class="btn-text_text">All solutions</div>
<div class="btn-text_svg-wrap hide">
